        "created_at": "2014-03-17T02:42:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Rules question about Citizen Tears.&nbsp; In reguards to her text which states \"If Citizen Blood is in play, this card deals each hero melee damage equal to the number of cards discarded by their players this turn.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, if this is the case and say I had 4 heros in the game and each of them discarded a card.&nbsp; Would each hero take 1 melee damage or each hero take 4 melee damage?</p>",
